            "review_text": "karng\n305 contributions\n0\nGood Food, Underwhelming Atmosphere\nJun 2026 • Solo\nThe broth wasn't very rich, but it was balanced and suited my taste. The noodles were cooked perfectly, and each type of meat was flavorful on its own. The main drawback was that the vegetables didn't seem very fresh. The restaurant atmosphere was also somewhat unwelcoming, and the dining area could have been cleaner.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 5, 2026",
